<programme start="20261027010000 +0000" stop="20261027020000 +0000" channel="Fox Business"><title lang="en">Kelsey Grammer&apos;s Historic Battles for America</title><sub-title lang="en">Brooklyn</sub-title><desc lang="en">As British warships fill the New York harbor, George Washington rallies his Continental Army for the biggest battle of the revolution; with his men backed into a corner on Brooklyn Heights, it takes a miracle to survive.</desc><category lang="en">History</category><category lang="en">Documentary</category><rating system="MPA"><value>TV-14</value></rating><icon src="https://cdn.tvpassport.com/image/show/960x540/v2/p22104946_b_v11_ab.jpg"/></programme>
