<programme start="20261026160000 +0000" stop="20261026180000 +0000" channel="NHL Network"><title lang="en">NHL Hockey</title><sub-title lang="en">Minnesota Wild at Vancouver Canucks</sub-title><desc lang="en">The Vancouver Canucks host the Minnesota Wild in an NHL regular-season matchup at Rogers Arena. Minnesota is 7-3 against Vancouver in its last 10 head-to-head meetings, with Vancouver winning its most recent matchup 5-2 at Rogers Arena in April 2026.</desc><category lang="en">Sports</category><category lang="en">Hockey</category><icon src="https://cdn.tvpassport.com/image/show/960x540/v2/p191278_b_v12_aa.jpg"/></programme>
<programme start="20261026180000 +0000" stop="20261026200000 +0000" channel="NHL Network"><title lang="en">NHL Hockey</title><sub-title lang="en">Florida Panthers at Chicago Blackhawks</sub-title><desc lang="en">The Chicago Blackhawks host the Florida Panthers at the United Center. The Panthers defeated the Blackhawks 5-1 at the United Center in January 2026. The Atlantic Division Panthers and Central Division Blackhawks teams clash again in the same venue.</desc><category lang="en">Sports</category><category lang="en">Hockey</category><icon src="https://cdn.tvpassport.com/image/show/960x540/v2/p191278_b_v12_aa.jpg"/></programme>
<programme start="20261026200000 +0000" stop="20261026210000 +0000" channel="NHL Network"><title lang="en">NHL Tonight</title><sub-title lang="en">First Shift</sub-title><desc lang="en">Whip around through live look-ins, real-time scores, breaking news and expert analysis with the studio hosts and seasoned NHL veterans. Stay on top of all the action around the league with NHL Tonight.</desc><category lang="en">Sports</category><category lang="en">Hockey</category><icon src="https://cdn.tvpassport.com/image/show/960x540/v2/p8940256_b_v12_ae.jpg"/></programme>
