<programme start="20261025110000 +0000" stop="20261025120000 +0000" channel="Smithsonian Channel"><title lang="en">Aerial America</title><sub-title lang="en">Boston 24</sub-title><desc lang="en">A day-long aerial tour of the New England city of Boston in Massachusetts; where Americans first rebelled against Britain by dumping chests of tea into the harbor and where rock band Aerosmith first made it big.</desc><category lang="en">Documentary</category><rating system="MPA"><value>TV-G</value></rating><icon src="https://cdn.tvpassport.com/image/show/960x540/v2/p8811095_b_v8_ap.jpg"/></programme>
