<programme start="20261026040000 +0000" stop="20261026050000 +0000" channel="Todo Drama"><title lang="es">El clon</title><sub-title lang="es">Adicciones</sub-title><desc lang="es">Said ayuda a Maysa para que esté más tranquila. Carol promete apoyar a Lobato con su alcoholismo. Nando y Ceceu fuman marihuana en casa de Lidiane. Albieri, al sentirse presionado, piensa en llevarse lejos a Léo.</desc><credits><director>Jayme Monjardim</director><actor>Murilo Benício</actor><actor>Giovanna Antonelli</actor><actor>Letícia Sabatella</actor><actor>Juca de Oliveira</actor><actor>Adriana Lessa</actor><actor>Vera Fischer</actor><actor>Reginaldo Faria</actor><actor>Dalton Vigh</actor><actor>Daniela Escobar</actor><actor>Débora Falabella</actor><actor>Eliane Giardini</actor><actor>Antonio Calloni</actor><actor>Stênio Garcia</actor><actor>Jandira Martini</actor><actor>Neuza Borges</actor><actor>Marcello Novaes</actor><actor>Cristiana Oliveira</actor><actor>Nívea Maria</actor><actor>Solange Couto</actor><actor>Osmar Prado</actor><actor>Cissa Guimarães</actor><actor>Marcos Frota</actor><actor>Sthefany Brito</actor></credits><date>20261021</date><episode-num system="xmltv_ns">0.131.0/1</episode-num><episode-num system="onscreen">S01E132</episode-num><rating><value>US_MPAA_UR</value></rating><icon src="http://p-img.movetv.com/1280x720/4161e7e51f30e947e24e25cc56ad0224.jpeg"/></programme>
