<programme start="20261027070000 +0000" stop="20261027080000 +0000" channel="Todo Drama"><title lang="es">Melissa</title><sub-title lang="es">Destino marcado</sub-title><desc lang="es">Orhan prepara una velada romántica para reconquistar a Azra, pero, de repente, ella se siente mal y sus sospechas son confirmadas. Reyhna lee el futuro de Öyku y le da malas noticias.</desc><credits><director>Çagil Aydogdu</director><actor>Beren Gökyıldız</actor><actor>Dila Uluca</actor><actor>Ümit Akdemir</actor><actor>Mahmoud Kasalkheh</actor><actor>Sezin Bozaci</actor><actor>Mert Aydogdu</actor><actor>Ali Senol</actor><actor>Onur Dikmen</actor></credits><date>20261026</date><episode-num system="xmltv_ns">0.133.0/1</episode-num><episode-num system="onscreen">S01E134</episode-num><rating><value>US_UPR_TV-14</value></rating><icon src="http://p-img.movetv.com/1920x1080/f4a66cab39e4b99a65045eda7d2ca7f2.jpeg"/></programme>
